# Alliance 30-32: Stranglethorn Vale
# Order from plan_zone.py (routes/drafts/Alliance_STV.route, --include 328), time-optimised against grinding and
# the next best zone (~24k XP/h at level 30). Quests wait until their targets are at most 3 levels above you.
