# Excelsior), Zimmix's Great Escape (no objective location in the data) and quests turned in on other maps.
# Edited by hand: the trip in, the Booty Bay flight path and the level gates.
guide Alliance 30-32 Stranglethorn Vale
file Alliance_STV
faction Alliance
races Human
levels 28 33
map 1434

# Getting there
note Run west along the Duskwood road, then south past Raven Hill into Stranglethorn Vale and on to the Rebel Camp just inside the border.
